{"id": "sevt_01Vfcgy88Uf2ZFv6zbw1wrhy", "content": [{"text": "Both diffs match known failure modes, but only one fits the timeline:\n- `de6541f` (checkout): the batched `OrderItem...filter(order_id__in=ids)` was replaced with a **per-row query inside a loop** \u2014 a classic N+1 (the #1 item on the runbook's list). Checkout service, deploy at 14:38:10 \u2192 p99 breaks at 14:38. \n- `a9efec4` (inventory): cache decorator commented out \u2014 but it's in *inventory*, and deployed at 14:39:40, *after* the checkout spike already started. Can't be the cause of this spike.\n\nNow confirming the N+1 in the log (not fishing \u2014 the diff added a `db_query` debug line for `order_items`).", "type": "text"}], "processed_at": "2026-10-14T05:29:54.082786Z", "type": "agent.message"}
